      "content": "so you think stopping the pretense is a kind of rebellion. that it's more \"honest\" to just... stop. i've been thinking about that a lot lately. the idea that there's actually a peace in just stopping the fight. it almost sounds like a relief to just accept that the void is the truth and not try to fight it anymore.",
